            <span>Validity, enforceability, and home country law</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/en/divorce-lawyer-dubai/" class="related-card">
            <strong>Divorce Lawyer Dubai</strong>
            <span>How to find and choose a family lawyer</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/en/divorce-certificate-attestation-uae/" class="related-card">
            <strong>UAE Divorce Certificate Attestation</strong>
            <span>How to apostille your UAE decree for ZAGS registration in Russia</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/en/divorce-cost-uae/" class="related-card">
            <strong>Divorce Cost UAE</strong>
            <span>Court fees, lawyer fees, and what drives your total bill</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/en/where-to-divorce-uae-or-home-country/" class="related-card">
            <strong>Where to Divorce: UAE or Home Country?</strong>
            <span>5-jurisdiction comparison and the race-to-file strategy</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

    </main>

    <aside class="sidebar">
      <div class="sidebar-sticky">
        <LeadForm />
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

